<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Zale started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Zale started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it started coverage of Zale Corp with near- and long-term buy ratings.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed Tuesday at 17-3/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
